/artifacts/

# Local run evidence: the category runners write their TRX and counter records here. A regeneration of
# CHANGELIST.md walked it once and offered to record 887 additions of test results into the section
# 4(b) notice, which is neither a source change nor something that may ever be tracked. Evidence that
# a record has to carry is copied into the record instead.
